mapping "W2582.1" source="W2582" target="218058005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W2582 SNOMED CT 218058005 = Swedish extension of ICD-10 W25 (Contact with sharp glass)
        subdivided by place (other specified) and activity (paid work). Target SNOMED CT 4315372
        (218058005), the standard crosswalk target for base W25. The target fully subsumes the source
        (every contact-with-sharp-glass-during-paid-work is an accident caused by glass edge), but drops
        the place and activity axes that the Swedish extension adds — one-level broader. High tier:
        verified Athena Maps-to crosswalk on the parent code, well-understood breadth mismatch. SNOMED CT
        has no concept combining glass + place + activity.
        """
}
